#: main.cpp:119
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "A unique name that represents this bookmark collection, usually the "
#| "kinstance name.\n"
#| "This should be \"konqueror\" for the konqueror bookmarks, \"kfile\" for "
#| "KFileDialog bookmarks, etc.\n"
#| "The final DBus object path is /KBookmarkManager/dbusObjectName"
msgid ""
"A unique name that represents this bookmark collection, usually the "
"kinstance name.\n"
"This should be \"konqueror\" for the Konqueror bookmarks, \"kfile\" for "
"KFileDialog bookmarks, etc.\n"
"The final D-Bus object path is /KBookmarkManager/dbusObjectName"
msgstr ""
"यो पुस्तकचिनो सङ्ग्रहलाई प्रतिनिधित्व गर्ने एउटा अद्वितिय नाम, प्राय: kinstance नाम "
"हुन्छ ।\n"
"कन्क्वेरर पुस्तकचिनोका लागि \"कन्क्वेरर\", केडीई फाइल संवाद पुस्तकचिनोका लागि \"केडीई फाइल"
"\", इत्यादि ।\n"
"अन्तिम DBus वस्तु मार्ग /KBookmarkManager/dbusObjectName हो"

